    <title>v0.3.13.post1</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CI/Build] Keep 0.3.13 non-CUDA wheels CUDA-free by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/Aionw/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Aionw&quot;&gt;@Aionw&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5274227000&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/3746&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3746/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3746&quot;&gt;#3746&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CI/Build] Backport TestPyPI pre-release gate to v0.3.13 by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/Aionw/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Aionw&quot;&gt;@Aionw&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5254523880&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/3697&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3697/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3697&quot;&gt;#3697&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/compare/v0.3.13...v0.3.13.post1&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v0.3.13...v0.3.13.post1&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
