  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/819733173/v0.3.13</id>
    <updated>2026-08-27T08:16:38Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/releases/tag/v0.3.13"/>
    <title>v0.3.13</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[TENT] Fix io_uring stale status in getTransferStatus by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/jfeng18/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/jfeng18&quot;&gt;@jfeng18&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4612214424&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2379&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2379/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2379&quot;&gt;#2379&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ci: add manual &quot;Cancel Queued and Running CI&quot; workflow by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/ShangmingCai/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ShangmingCai&quot;&gt;@ShangmingCai&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4974621852&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/3117&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3117/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3117&quot;&gt;#3117&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ci: fix cancel-ci listing that matched no runs by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/ShangmingCai/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ShangmingCai&quot;&gt;@ShangmingCai&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4979212508&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/3123&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3123/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3123&quot;&gt;#3123&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[TENT] Fix req_map_ leak for single-task batches in ascend transport by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/jfeng18/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/jfeng18&quot;&gt;@jfeng18&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4974534403&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/3116&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3116/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3116&quot;&gt;#3116&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[PG] Forward collectives through the backend shim for PyTorch 2.13 by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/mmangkad/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/mmangkad&quot;&gt;@mmangkad&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4976590776&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/3122&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3122/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3122&quot;&gt;#3122&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Store] implement RFC &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4816867009&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2756&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2756/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2756&quot;&gt;#2756&lt;/a&gt; batch-record HA OpLog writer by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/Icedcoco/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Icedcoco&quot;&gt;@Icedcoco&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4846385249&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2826&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2826/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2826&quot;&gt;#2826&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix:  allocation_strategy not taking effect when enable_ha is enabled on master by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/gitgaoqian/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/gitgaoqian&quot;&gt;@gitgaoqian&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4957085630&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/3077&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3077/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3077&quot;&gt;#3077&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CI] Add nightly build/release and test workflow by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/stmatengss/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/stmatengss&quot;&gt;@stmatengss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4899935189&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2950&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2950/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2950&quot;&gt;#2950&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CI] Add staryxchen for Mooncake TE&#39;s codeowner by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/alogfans/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/alogfans&quot;&gt;@alogfans&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4984915127&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/3132&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3132/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3132&quot;&gt;#3132&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[TransferEngine] Harden socket handshake frame handling by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/alogfans/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/alogfans&quot;&gt;@alogfans&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4946889982&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/3050&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3050/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3050&quot;&gt;#3050&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Bugfix] Fix double free of RDMA slice on device-selection failure by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/SongOf/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SongOf&quot;&gt;@SongOf&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4980120122&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/3125&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3125/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3125&quot;&gt;#3125&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[tent] Fix Prometheus histogram silent-drop and clean stale config keys by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/staryxchen/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/staryxchen&quot;&gt;@staryxchen&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4980472806&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/3126&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3126/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3126&quot;&gt;#3126&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[PG][2/N] Introduce Control Plane by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/caozhanhao/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/caozhanhao&quot;&gt;@caozhanhao&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4655320937&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2455&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2455/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2455&quot;&gt;#2455&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fix(rdma): auto-chunk MRs larger than device max_mr_size (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4355872513&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2017&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2017/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2017&quot;&gt;#2017&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/jiejingzhangamd/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/jiejingzhangamd&quot;&gt;@jiejingzhangamd&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4756412503&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2644&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2644/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2644&quot;&gt;#2644&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[P2P-Store] Fix double-close panic, refCount copy, and offset reset by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/jfeng18/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/jfeng18&quot;&gt;@jfeng18&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4611984907&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2375&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2375/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2375&quot;&gt;#2375&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CI/Build] master image: install ibverbs-providers and publish a CUDA 13 flavor by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/tpiperatgod/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/tpiperatgod&quot;&gt;@tpiperatgod&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4975792440&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/3121&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3121/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/3121&quot;&gt;#3121&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
