  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/819733173/v0.3.12.post1</id>
    <updated>2026-07-25T05:15:38Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/releases/tag/v0.3.12.post1"/>
    <title>v0.3.12.post1</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[build] Strip shared libraries to reduce NPU wheel size by @JieTang66 in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4510737803&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2202&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2202/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2202&quot;&gt;#2202&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Docs] Update README with citation details by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/UNIDY2002/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/UNIDY2002&quot;&gt;@UNIDY2002&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4501180598&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2190&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2190/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2190&quot;&gt;#2190&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Doc]: Update vLLM LMCache guide for MP interface by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/fcczzz/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/fcczzz&quot;&gt;@fcczzz&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4512077185&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2209&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2209/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2209&quot;&gt;#2209&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Store] fix gauge overflow by separating DFS unlimited flag by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/LujhCoconut/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/LujhCoconut&quot;&gt;@LujhCoconut&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4483019579&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2152&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2152/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2152&quot;&gt;#2152&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
