    <title>v0.3.12</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;docs: reflect WITH_NVIDIA_PEERMEM change from CMake flag to runtime env var by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/stmatengss/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/stmatengss&quot;&gt;@stmatengss&lt;/a&gt; with @Copilot in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4491576096&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2164&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2164/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2164&quot;&gt;#2164&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;feat(rdma): mlx5dv QP path diversity via UDP sport and LAG port balance by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/staryxchen/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/staryxchen&quot;&gt;@staryxchen&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4496063101&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2175&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2175/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2175&quot;&gt;#2175&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[TENT] Enhanced QoS and Slice Spraying for TENT by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/alogfans/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/alogfans&quot;&gt;@alogfans&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4396319076&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2048&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2048/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2048&quot;&gt;#2048&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[TENT] Add codeowner to the TENT directory by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/alogfans/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/alogfans&quot;&gt;@alogfans&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4500210342&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2183&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2183/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2183&quot;&gt;#2183&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add release-npu workflow by @JieTang66 in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4499567253&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2178&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2178/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2178&quot;&gt;#2178&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[chore] Set default for WITH_NVIDIA_PEERMEM to true by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/ShangmingCai/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ShangmingCai&quot;&gt;@ShangmingCai&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4501600370&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2192&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2192/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2192&quot;&gt;#2192&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Store] Add structured object store helper by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/zxpdemonio/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/zxpdemonio&quot;&gt;@zxpdemonio&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4476132188&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2140&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2140/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2140&quot;&gt;#2140&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump version to 0.3.11.post1 in pyproject.toml by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/ShangmingCai/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ShangmingCai&quot;&gt;@ShangmingCai&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4501727403&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2194&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2194/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2194&quot;&gt;#2194&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[build] Strip shared libraries to reduce NPU wheel size by @JieTang66 in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4510737803&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2202&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2202/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2202&quot;&gt;#2202&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Docs] Update README with citation details by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/UNIDY2002/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/UNIDY2002&quot;&gt;@UNIDY2002&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4501180598&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2190&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2190/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2190&quot;&gt;#2190&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Doc]: Update vLLM LMCache guide for MP interface by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/fcczzz/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/fcczzz&quot;&gt;@fcczzz&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4512077185&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2209&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2209/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2209&quot;&gt;#2209&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Store] fix gauge overflow by separating DFS unlimited flag by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/LujhCoconut/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/LujhCoconut&quot;&gt;@LujhCoconut&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4483019579&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2152&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2152/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2152&quot;&gt;#2152&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Store]: avoid INVALID_REPLICA error on empty offload  by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/LujhCoconut/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/LujhCoconut&quot;&gt;@LujhCoconut&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4482840176&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2151&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2151/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2151&quot;&gt;#2151&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Store] Fix: Auto-recovery for SSD Offload after Master Restart by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/Colors-111/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Colors-111&quot;&gt;@Colors-111&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4417910261&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2077&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2077/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2077&quot;&gt;#2077&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Store] Fix: validate HA backend availability during config parsing by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/Lin-z-w/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Lin-z-w&quot;&gt;@Lin-z-w&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4452989668&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/2111&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2111/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/pull/2111&quot;&gt;#2111&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
